<node id="tier:fb3c1c50a4d1">
  <data key="d0">SponsorshipTier</data>
  <data key="d41">Title Sponsor</data>
  <data key="d42">Taken for 2026</data>
  <data key="d43">শিরোনাম Title Sponsor Taken for 2026 Recognised as "Company Presents" across every creative Powered by Genotypic Group Ten promotional banners and standees through all event days Dedicated exhibition stall for all event days Premium stage branding and logo on official merchandise Brand presence in the magazine, invitation cards and brochures Promotional video on the venue LED display at peak hours Dedicated sponsor showcase across our social media On-stage acknowledgement at every cultural programme</data>
