<node id="sound:6aa284e631b6">
  <data key="d0">SoundscapeLayer</data>
  <data key="d61">Krishnarajendra Market in Bengaluru: several hundred people talking at once, none of them to you. The nearest thing to pandal adda that exists under a licence we can use, and recorded in this city, which feels right for a Puja held in it.</data>
  <data key="d66">CC BY-SA 3.0 Krishnarajendra Market in Bengaluru: several hundred people talking at once, none of them to you. The nearest thing to pandal adda that exists under a licence we can use, and recorded in this city, which feels right for a Puja held in it. “Bangalore, Krishnarajendra-market, City market” by François-Emmanuel Fodéré, radio aporee ::: maps, via the Internet Archive, CC BY-SA 3.0</data>
  <data key="d9">আড্ডা CC BY-SA 3.0 Krishnarajendra Market in Bengaluru: several hundred people talking at once, none of them to you. The nearest thing to pandal adda that exists under a licence we can use, and recorded in this city, which feels right for a Puja held in it. “Bangalore, Krishnarajendra-market, City market” by François-Emmanuel Fodéré, radio aporee ::: maps, via the Internet Archive, CC BY-SA 3.0</data>
