<node id="sound:3193872b1d99">
  <data key="d0">SoundscapeLayer</data>
  <data key="d61">Bells, chanting and a crowd together at a math in Hubli on Maha Shivaratri. A different festival and a different state, but the sound of an evening arati is the sound of an evening arati.</data>
  <data key="d66">CC BY-SA 3.0 Bells, chanting and a crowd together at a math in Hubli on Maha Shivaratri. A different festival and a different state, but the sound of an evening arati is the sound of an evening arati. “Hubli, Sri Gurunathrudha Swami Math, Bells &amp; Co” by François-Emmanuel Fodéré, radio aporee ::: maps, via the Internet Archive, CC BY-SA 3.0</data>
