  <data key="d66">CC0 1.0 A sustained Indian drone, released under CC0. It is labelled drone rather than tanpura because the person who uploaded it wrote only "loop like indian drone", and nobody here has been able to confirm whether it is a played instrument or a synthesised one. Calling it a tanpura would be a guess with a confident face. Labelled drone, not tanpura. Nobody has confirmed the instrument. “23 indian drone” by abeattie23, via the Internet Archive, CC0 1.0 (no attribution required)</data>
